m/franckl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/franckl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/franckl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/franckl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/franckl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/franckl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/franckl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/franckl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/franckl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/franckl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/72386914","html_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/1759#issuecomment-72386914","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/1759","id":72386914,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcyMzg2OTE0","user":{"login":"btmills","id":1709537,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDk1Mzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1709537?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills","html_url":"https://github.com/btmills","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-02-01T22:02:28Z","updated_at":"2015-02-01T22:02:28Z","body":"Here's a repro:\n\n``` js\n// test.js\nvar arguments;\n\nfunction bar() { }\n\n```\n\n``` sh\n$ eslint --reset --no-eslintrc --rule \"no-shadow: 2\" test.js\n\n/Users/brandon/code/eslint/eslint/lib/eslint.js:704\n            location = node.loc.start;\n                           ^\nTypeError: Cannot read property 'loc' of undefinedTypeError: Cannot read property 'loc' of undefined\n    at EventEmitter.module.exports.api.report (~/code/eslint/eslint/lib/eslint.js:704:28)\n    at RuleContext.report (~/code/eslint/eslint/lib/rule-context.js:96:16)\n    at ~/code/eslint/eslint/lib/rules/no-shadow.js:38:25\n    at Array.forEach (native)\n    at checkShadowsInScope (~/code/eslint/eslint/lib/rules/no-shadow.js:36:19)\n    at EventEmitter.checkForShadows (~/code/eslint/eslint/lib/rules/no-shadow.js:54:13)\n    at EventEmitter.emit (events.js:95:17)\n    at Controller.controller.traverse.enter (~/code/eslint/eslint/lib/eslint.js:657:25)\n    at Controller.__execute (~/code/eslint/eslint/node_modules/estraverse/estraverse.js:397:31)\n    at Controller.traverse (~/code/eslint/eslint/node_modules/estraverse/estraverse.js:495:28)\n```\n\nThe offending section of `lib/rules/no-shadow.js`:\n\n``` js\n29 /**\n30  * Checks if the given variables are shadowed in the given scope.\n31  * @param {Array} variables The variables to look for\n32  * @param {Object} scope The scope to be checked.\n33  * @returns {void}\n34  */\n35 function checkShadowsInScope(variables, scope) {\n36     variables.forEach(function (variable) {\n37         if (isContainedInScopeVars(variable, scope.variables)) {\n38             context.report(variable.identifiers[0], \"{{a}} is already declared in the upper scope.\", {a: variable.name});\n39         }\n40     });\n41 }\n```\n\nThe `arguments` variable introduced by the function scope shadows the outer `arguments` variable. It tries to warn using the location of the inner (implicit) `arguments` variable's declaration, but there's no corresponding `VariableDeclarator` node in the AST.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/72386914/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"btmills","id":1709537,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDk1Mzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1709537?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills","html_url":"https://github.com/btmills","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/btmills/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/72388859","html_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/1759#issuecomment-72388859","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/1759","id":72388859,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcyMzg4ODU5","user":{"login":"michaelficarra","id":218840,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxODg0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra","html_url":"https://github.com/michaelficarra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-02-01T22:39:22Z","updated_at":"2015-02-01T22:39:22Z","body":"Seems like you should just except variables named `arguments` from this rule.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/72388859/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"michaelficarra","id":218840,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxODg0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra","html_url":"https://github.com/michaelficarra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/72525302","html_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/1759#issuecomment-72525302","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/1759","id":72525302,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcyNTI1MzAy","user":{"login":"gcochard","id":2836237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MzYyMzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2836237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcochard","html_url":"https://github.com/gcochard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcochard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcochard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcochard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcochard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcochard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcochard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcochard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcochard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gcochard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-02-02T19:54:00Z","updated_at":"2015-02-02T19:54:00Z","body":"Arguably, it's a better idea to not name any variables `arguments`, as using this code in a different environment will introduce subtle errors that the author may not have expected.\n\nFor example: using a variable named `arguments` is a syntax error in strict mode.\n\nAdditionally, this does actually shadow in the node environment when not in strict mode due to [the way node wraps javascript files](https://github.com/joyent/node/blob/v0.10.36/src/node.js#L910-L913).\n\nPerhaps this rule should use the `context.settings.environments` object to determine (with relatively strong confidence) whether `arguments` is _actually_ being shadowed.\n\nSide note: Is the `context.settings` object exposed to the rule?\n","author_associa