jary/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilovejary/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilovejary/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilovejary/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilovejary/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilovejary/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2015-02-05T04:02:59Z","updated_at":"2015-02-05T05:17:36Z","body":"How about making sure the test only runs when `node` is defined?\n\n```\n/**\n * Checks if the given variables are shadowed in the given scope.\n * @param {Array} variables The variables to look for\n * @param {Object} scope The scope to be checked.\n * @returns {void}\n */\nfunction checkShadowsInScope(variables, scope) {\n    variables.filter(function (variable) {\n        return (variable.identifiers.length > 0);\n    }).forEach(function (variable) {\n        if (isContainedInScopeVars(variable, scope.variables)) {\n            context.report(variable.identifiers[0], \"{{a}} is already declared in the upper scope.\", {a: variable.name});\n        }\n    });\n}\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/72990757/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ilovejary","id":2186228,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxODYyMjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2186228?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilovejary","html_url":"https://github.com/ilovejary","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilovejary/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilovejary/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilovejary/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilovejary/st